Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:44.99,0:07:45.76,6a395b88d3afaa4f078b41af,Ksenks,0,0,0,,Ну, может, да.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.78,0:07:46.22,6a395b88d3afaa4f078b41b0,Umputun,0,0,0,,Зацепится.
