Dialogue: Marked=0,2:04:35.57,2:04:37.41,6a395b88d3afaa4f078b4853,Alek.sys,0,0,0,,Как говорится, you literally had one job.
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:04:39.07,2:04:40.61,6a395b88d3afaa4f078b4854,Alek.sys,0,0,0,,Ну, ладно.
